T(n,m):=if m>n then 0 else if n=0 then 1 else sum((n-1)!/(k-1)!*binomial(2*n-k-1,n-1)*sum((-1)^j*(m+1-j)^k*binomial(k+1,j),j,0,m),k,m+1,n);

